Runtime system prompts wld be cool if we handle the entry point of the session (i.e. we have an alias that that builds a custom agent config at runtime before the kiro-cli runs)

The benefit of this is to conditionally add system prompts based on the project/epic or even the specific conversation.

The concept is we have building blocks of system prompts that can be added in and out of the session at runtime before we even invoke the session.

